{"title":"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/9/40920163c12ad9f3ce69942d9b625b88ac82923f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/c/c0c1c057faf7c7ba099686a27d00c4c4cac70682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin x&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"68\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/0/120c8bdd671388886d3e1cbdb88632028f4e5225.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos x&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/6/c167ed95fd85ce79e52e79abf9d9fc9bc13b340e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b \\sin x = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/6/b56ea27a1682d38216adf8737ed9fe835bfa9589.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b \\cos x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"17\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/1/fd19e9d9fcbe6bf35f51d8adfefb304f238623bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ 2\\log_b(1-b^{a/2}) ~~\\text{(B)} \\ \\sqrt{1-a^2} ~~\\text{(C)} \\ b^{a^2} ~~\\text{(D)} \\ \\frac 12 \\log_b(1-b^{2a}) ~~\\text{(E)} \\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"609\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/6/c167ed95fd85ce79e52e79abf9d9fc9bc13b340e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b \\sin x = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/4/8f430e2d18a99536d85b94f7072fd024203e48bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^a=\\sin x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"78\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3e74131c6ddd6bdf662af3def4bc56b83b5909d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = \\log_b \\cos x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"105\" height=\"19\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/4/144c575b489ae5a6d1fd9f8f5c7f4dde40e375cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^c=\\cos x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"78\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/1/3219d16158f4b68175e655cd13eb32fe26ea845c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin^2x+\\cos^2x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"143\" height=\"17\" />, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/5/605e9e508bc763c5ea257396727557b6681839fa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(b^c)^2+(b^a)^2=1\\]\" width=\"126\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/b/f7b34ab01d51fdafb59c1d1b2e10f8c3238ea83f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^{2c}+b^{2a}=1\\]\" width=\"97\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/6/3366d9834575c0c37048035fc716f6c8118c0802.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^{2c}=1-b^{2a}\\]\" width=\"97\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/b/afb0b5899af5cfbb6d3de2eb1317a702ae3883f5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_b (1-b^{2a}) = 2c\\]\" width=\"138\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/d/c2ddd72068cebf8903fa410c904930a0990a43ed.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[c=\\boxed{(\\textbf{D}) \\ \\frac 12 \\log_b(1-b^{2a})}\\]\" width=\"191\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>-aopspandy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME\" title=\"1980 AHSME\">1980 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1980 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1980\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1980 AHSME Proble